&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data analysis and interpretation&lt;/strong&gt;: use tools like Excel, SQL, and Python to analyze data, apply statistical techniques to uncover trends and patterns, and present clear, actionable insights to clients, ensuring clarity for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational background:&lt;/strong&gt; a completed Bachelor degree, ideally focusing on Technology or (Business) Economics (MSc, MBA), with strong academic performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
