&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us now and be part of the future:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is experiencing exciting growth, and this is the perfect time to join our dynamic team and contribute to our success story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply today!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a global consulting firm specialising in &lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt;, dedicated to transforming data into measurable business impact. We combine business consulting with deep expertise in data, AI, analytics, and technology to help organisations accelerate their transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our multidisciplinary teams bring together consultants, data scientists, data engineers, AI engineers, and technology experts to deliver impactful solutions for leading organisations around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to grow our Data &amp;amp; AI capabilities in Southeast Asia, we are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an AI Engineer, you will be a hands-on builder, working on the design, development, and deployment of &lt;strong&gt;AI and Generative AI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work within multidisciplinary teams and collaborate directly with client stakeholders to transform business challenges and ideas into practical, scalable AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Deploy AI Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, prototype, test, and deploy AI/ML and Generative AI solutions, from PoCs through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
