&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in GCP security, networking, and compliance best practices (VPC Service Controls, IAM, Organization Policy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designed end-to-end GCP environments&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that are highly available, secure, and cost-efficient—leveraging Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE), Cloud Run, Compute Engine, and Cloud SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defined global DR/HA strategies&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;using Cloud Load Balancing, Cloud CDN, and automated failover with multi-region Bigtable/Spanner or persistent disk replication, achieving sub-hour RTOs for critical workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architected end-to-end data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;—built both streaming and batch ETL workflows using Pub/Sub, Dataflow (Apache Beam), and Dataproc to ingest high-throughput events into BigQuery for real-time insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designed scalable data models in BigQuery&lt;/strong&gt;—implemented dimensional schemas with partitioning and clustering to achieve sub-second query times on petabyte-scale datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrated and scheduled workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;leveraging Cloud Composer (Airflow) and Workflows—added automated retries, data-quality validations, and alerting to guarantee pipeline reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated infrastructure lifecycle via Terraform and Cloud Build pipelines—implementing auto-scaling, patch management, and monitoring workflows that boosted operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mastery of cost control in GCP:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;committed-use discounts, custom machine types, billing export analytics, and budget alerts, plus high-availability patterns for resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnered with data teams to fine-tune architectures on Cloud Storage, BigQuery, Dataflow, and Dataproc—delivering performant, scalable analytics platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership in guiding cross-functional teams and steering complex, multi-phase cloud projects to on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator, adept at crafting business-focused presentations and leading stakeholder workshops on GCP strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solver, experienced in diagnosing and resolving architectural challenges across compute, data, and networking domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at stakeholder management, from technical deep dives with engineering teams to strategic discussions with C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; coaching:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;developing cloud engineering talent through hands-on training, code reviews, and best-practice evangelism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business growth driver&lt;/strong&gt;, recognized for leveraging GCP innovations to unlock new revenue streams and streamline operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Artefact is a leading global consulting company dedicated to accelerating the adoption of data and AI to positively impact people and organizations. We specialize in data and AI transformation and data marketing to drive tangible business results across the entire enterprise value chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact offers the most comprehensive set of data-driven solutions per industry, built on deep data science and cutting-edge AI technologies, delivering AI projects at scale in all industry sectors. From strategy to operations, we offer an end-to-end approach and solutions: data strategy, data quality and governance, data platforms, AI Factory, data-driven customer experience and marketing ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 2000+ employees operate in 27 countries (Europe, Asia, Americas, Middle East, Africa) and we partner with 1000 clients, including some of the world&#39;s top 300 brands such as Samsung, L&#39;Oréal and Sanofi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a leading global consulting company dedicated to accelerating the adoption of data and AI to positively impact people and organizations. We specialize in data and AI transformation and data marketing to drive tangible business results across the entire enterprise value chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact offers the most comprehensive set of data-driven solutions per industry, built on deep data science and cutting-edge AI technologies, delivering AI projects at scale in all industry sectors. From strategy to operations, we offer an end-to-end approach and solutions: data strategy, data quality and governance, data platforms, AI Factory, data-driven customer experience and marketing ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 2000+ employees operate in 27 countries (Europe, Asia, Americas, Middle East, Africa) and we partner with 1000 clients, including some of the world&#39;s top 300 brands such as Samsung, L&#39;Oréal and Sanofi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Consulting Chapter leads the way in effectively exploiting data in all its forms. Are you ready to take ownership of transforming clients&#39; businesses at scale? Do you want to shape how organisations implement best-in-class data and AI strategies, collect and integrate data, and securely and cost-effectively store and analyse it? Join our leadership team and drive the growth of our international client portfolio!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to one of the Partners for Benelux, your role will encompass:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading Client Portfolios:&lt;/strong&gt; Own a portfolio of strategic accounts, bringing together consulting, technology and AI talent to deliver transformative, sustainable solutions. Set the vision for how teams are staffed and structured, and hold ultimate accountability for the quality and business impact of what gets delivered across your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice &amp;amp; Delivery Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee multiple workstreams, projects, and Consulting Managers across your portfolio, ensuring delivery excellence. Anticipate risks, resolve escalations, and take ultimate ownership of budget, capacity planning, and reporting across engagements. Set the standard for mission deliverables, presentations, case studies, and impactful client-facing content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the senior trusted advisor to C-level and senior client stakeholders. Bring a strong point of view to strategic conversations, identify and close new business opportunities, and lead high-stakes pitches and proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full ownership of growing the business -&amp;nbsp; building your network, originating opportunities, shaping and leading proposals, and driving initiatives that materially contribute to Artefact&#39;s growth and market positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coaching &amp;amp; People Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor and develop Consulting Managers and senior consultants, give regular feedback, and actively shape career paths across the team. Building strong leaders under you is a core measure of your success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Impact &amp;amp; Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and drive areas of expertise (strategy, data governance, data marketing, etc.) at a practice level, ensuring knowledge sharing across the Consulting department. Represent Artefact at external events, drive thought leadership content, and play a leading role in recruitment strategy and senior hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have demonstrated success over 8+ years working in the field of data and AI, including at least 5+ years within a consulting firm, with a track record of leading teams and client portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity for Tech &amp;amp; AI:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re genuinely curious about how technology, data and AI reshape business. You don&#39;t need to be an expert in all three — you&#39;re eager to learn, experiment, and go deep where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Impact Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You connect technical possibility to business value at a strategic level, and hold a high bar for quality of delivery across your entire portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You appreciate how things are built under the hood and enjoy partnering closely with engineers and technologists, even if you&#39;re not one yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You love data and believe decisions should be driven by facts — backed by real technical aptitude across concepts like data governance, MLOps, GenAI, cloud strategy, and FinOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; You take ownership like a founder would — proactive, accountable, and comfortable building something new rather than just executing a plan. A can-do mentality is second nature to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Development &amp;amp; Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy coaching and developing leaders, and see building a strong team under you as core to your own success and to the practice&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in English is required, any other language is considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt; You are curious, hands-on and passionate about solving ambiguous technological problems with a can-do attitude, and comfortable operating at a senior, client-facing level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a team of passionate Data Consultants always ready to help each other, providing opportunities to learn and collaborate with some of the best in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Celebration:&lt;/strong&gt; We pride ourselves on creating a collaborative and fun work environment with regular team events and activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy a comprehensive benefits package, including a competitive salary, phone &amp;amp; travel reimbursements, remote work allowance, and a Onefit membership discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer flexibility with a hybrid working environment that lets you balance personal and professional commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel Your Day:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy a healthy and delicious daily lunch from our extensive organic buffet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly Unwind:&lt;/strong&gt; Take advantage of our weekly massage sessions to de-stress and relax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Centrally Located:&lt;/strong&gt; Our office is conveniently situated near the station for easy commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re committed to your professional development, offering continuous learning and internal promotion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Us Now and Be Part of the Future:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is experiencing exciting growth, and this is the perfect time to join our dynamic team and contribute to our success story.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Help our clients in their AI transformations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in AI applications to help clients achieve tangible business impact. Our Belgium office advises clients on their most pressing strategic challenges : from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have 2000+ employees across 36 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the management, your role will be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage projects, or commercial proposal preparation process, involving the management of multidisciplinary teams, including Consultants, Data Scientists, Data Engineers, Creatives, Media experts and etc ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle clients directly on project assignments (run workshops, client meetings, formal presentations and etc) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the best of our expertise from the other chapters to your clients on Data Science, Activation (e.g., media buying, CRM, ...) and Creativity ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact-driven with real sales abilities, you will have to embark our clients into a transformation of their marketing, CRM, Supply Chain departments and make sure Artefact is their preferred partner in this endeavor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Among your responsibilities as Consulting Director, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop client portfolio (hunting) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly stay on top of the Data, AI, Marketing content ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a commercial strategy to develop the country client portfolio through personal contacts, events, cold calls, and etc ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the commercial pipeline ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proposals supporting the client needs ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver the highest standards of quality on your projects ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilot multidisciplinary teams (consultants, data scientists, strategic planners, media traders);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the highest level of quality of output to your clients ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the success of the projects from a client and team perspective ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop our Global Knowledge platform ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build stronghold of knowledge through your clients’ engagements (frameworks, methodologies, technologies, ...) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the spread of the Consulting Department knowledge across the company at local and Global level (in coordination with the Consulting Practice)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in your first 6+ years of career at a tier 1 consulting firm and have 4+ years of experience managing projects and/or clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience in data related topics, including but not limited to data transformation program, cloud infrastructure, AI &amp;amp; machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest and appetite in Data, Marketing &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly adaptable, able to cope with different topics and situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in Dutch (native or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; People of different background and expertise working closely together;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust &amp;amp; Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt; Dealing with data topics with integrity and ethics; Realistic and honest with our capabilities and limitations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation: &lt;/strong&gt;Always working on the most trendy and new topics on data and digital; Always on top of the new ways of using data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Action:&lt;/strong&gt; We would rather do than to tell what to do; Has a “building the plane while flying” agile mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value technical leadership, a drive to innovate, and the ability to bring out the best in others. If you&#39;re ready to own the technical direction of cutting-edge AI projects and make a tangible impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consulting Director Based in Séoul&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you think like a management consultant, thrive in a startup environment, and can’t stop thinking about the intersection of data, technology, and marketing? With over 1000 employees, offices on five continents, and world-class clients like Samsung, L’Oreal, LVMH ... Artefact is a consulting firm that transforms data into value and business impact. We’re opening our first Korean office in Séoul, and we want you to join us to build the business in Korea!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded and headquartered in Paris, Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm, specializing in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organizations. We are proud to say that we help our clients grow their data and digital capabilities, and that we’re also growing in parallel. Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients&#39; specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we&#39;ve acquired with our 300+ client base around the globe. We have 800 employees across 14 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation.&lt;br&gt;Our state-of-the-art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts are all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more at Artefact.com&lt;br&gt;What you will be doing&lt;br&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;br&gt;Having recently opened our first office in Séoul, we are looking for a Director to join Artefact consulting practice and grow our footprint within the Korean market. As an experienced consultant, you will play a key role in winning and overseeing consulting engagements, serving as primary contact with clients, assuming the lead role with internal teams of consultants and data scientists, and engaging resources across Artefact’s global offices.&lt;br&gt;Your role will encompass :&lt;br&gt;● Building Artefact’s Korean presence, serving in a leadership capacity for Séoul office, being part of the Partner Group in APAC (offices in Singapore, Hong-Kong, Shanghai and Chengdu), with strong relationships with Artefact global practices (Data Marketing,...)&lt;br&gt;● Creating real impact with clients : winning consulting engagements and overseeing their delivery, transforming data into added value and making sure our clients reap all the benefits.&lt;br&gt;● Bringing your industry and/or functional expertise to help both our own and our client teams develop themselves.&lt;br&gt;● Leading and supporting our clients’ top executives (CMO, CDO, sometimes directly the CEO) with transformation of their business and making sure Artefact is their preferred partner in this endeavor.&lt;br&gt;● Contributing to content development and writing on business-relevant topics (e.g. Artefact published research, articles and business cases).&lt;br&gt;Among your responsibilities as Director, you will :&lt;br&gt;● Deliver the highest standards of quality on your projects&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Pilot multidisciplinary teams (consultants, data scientists, strategic planners, media traders) Ensure the highest level of quality of output to your clients&lt;br&gt;Accountable for the success of the projects from a client and team perspective&lt;br&gt;Lead &amp;amp; develop Séoul’s consulting team&lt;br&gt;Develop consultants&#39; expertise through training and best practice sharing with the other countries (digital ecosystem, consulting hard skills, soft skills, etc.)&lt;br&gt;Communicate the department&#39;s successes and results at the country level (ex: through events and PR)&lt;br&gt;Develop the consulting offer with existing clients, especially with Activation or Data clients Create opportunities for other Departments with your clients (Data Science, Activation, Creativity)&lt;br&gt;Build a commercial strategy to develop the country&#39;s client portfolio (consulting is a very good step in the door) through personal contacts, events, cold calls, ...&lt;br&gt;Monitor the commercial pipeline&lt;br&gt;Build proposals supporting the client needs&lt;br&gt;What we are looking for&lt;br&gt;You have demonstrated success in your first 6+ years of career at a tier 1 consulting firm and have 4+ years of experience managing projects and/or clients.&lt;br&gt;● DOER : you get things done yourself and inspire your teams to do so&lt;br&gt;● ANALYTIC : you LOVE data and think every company should take their decisions with facts&lt;br&gt;● HUNTER : you identify business opportunities and enjoy&lt;br&gt;● MOVER AND SHAKER : you have a hacker mindset and always find the quick wins&lt;br&gt;● MENTOR : your clients and teams naturally seek for advice&lt;br&gt;● AUTONOMOUS : you’re an entrepreneur...&lt;br&gt;Why you should join us ?&lt;br&gt;● Be on a startup team at an established global company: you will be joining a team of driven entrepreneurs. The Artefact Korean business is at the beginning of an exciting growth journey and you’ll be part of the founding team!&lt;br&gt;● Get immersed into the digital and data industry: meet the most innovative partners, deliver cutting-edge projects, and see the industry from backstage. Sooner than you think, you’ll talk about Machine Learning, DevOps and AI like a pro.&lt;br&gt;● Develop your skill set: every day offers new challenges and new opportunities to learn. At Artefact, we take training very seriously, and you’ll be coached and mentored on your technical, consulting, and interpersonal skills on a regular basis.&lt;br&gt;● Make an impact for our clients: come and help industry leaders transform through data! We are devoted to our clients’ success and work hand-in hand with them to upskill their teams and help them reach their goals.&lt;br&gt;● Join a community: join a team of 800 experts and professionals worldwide that will always be willing to help; be part of a startup environment in Séoul, which will make you feel welcome and help you thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation du poste :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recrutons un(e) Consulting Manager pour piloter la définition de stratégies Data &amp;amp; IA auprès de nos clients C-Level (COMEX, marketing, digital, supply-chain, opérations, customer support, IT...). Le/la Manager fait grandir des équipes pluridisciplinaires, pilote le business development, et agit également en tant que leader des opérations sur des sujets stratégiques transverses (RH, recrutement, innovation, management agile, industrialisation).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter des projets à haute valeur stratégique en s&#39;appuyant sur les offres Artefact (stratégie Data &amp;amp; IA, business case, gouvernance de la donnée, cadrage et déploiement de cas d&#39;usage, conduite du changement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager et faire grandir des équipes pluridisciplinaires (consultants, data scientists, data engineers, data analysts) sur des projets de bout en bout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le business development : réponses aux appels d&#39;offres, ouverture de nouveaux territoires commerciaux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renforcer les relations clients existantes et identifier de nouvelles opportunités commerciales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structurer l&#39;approche de résolution des problématiques métier et assurer le delivery opérationnel des projets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Devenir référent(e) sur une ou plusieurs expertises (stratégie, data governance, data marketing...) et contribuer à leur développement : construction d&#39;offres, formation des consultants, partenariats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Représenter Artefact lors d&#39;événements externes et contribuer à la création de contenu marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 ans d&#39;expérience minimum en cabinet de conseil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience en gestion du personnel, avec une capacité avérée à développer de jeunes talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aisance dans l&#39;identification d&#39;opportunités commerciales et le développement de relations clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esprit analytique, curiosité pour la data et les évolutions technologiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise de la Suite Google/Pack Office ; excellente communication en français et en anglais (écrit/oral)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localisation en plein cœur de Paris (9ème arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnement pluridisciplinaire en forte croissance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formations régulières et montée en compétences sur les méthodes de travail tech (product mindset, agilité)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture entrepreneuriale fondée sur l&#39;innovation, la collaboration et l&#39;action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Interview&lt;/strong&gt; : 30/45&#39; - entretien de motivation, culture et éligibilité avec un(e) Talent Acquisition Specialist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Director&lt;/strong&gt; : Business case - partie fit (motivation, soft skills, valeurs) puis use case avec synthèse de la solution (réponse, durée, équipe)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; : Business case - partie fit (motivation, soft skills, valeurs) puis use case avec synthèse de la solution (réponse, durée, équipe)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing Partner&lt;/strong&gt; : Business case - partie fit (motivation, soft skills, valeurs) puis use case avec synthèse de la solution (réponse, durée, équipe)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération : &lt;/strong&gt;66 000€ à 75 000€ brut annuel (fixe) + 10 000€ de variable, selon expérience et séniorité&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation entreprise :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable.&amp;nbsp;A la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Envie d&#39;en savoir plus? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : https://www.artefact.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion et diversité :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of data and AI consultancy, and one of the fastest growing. We&#39;ve grown to 2000 people, now serving over 3,000 clients across 36 offices in 26 countries. Founded in 2014 and backed by Cinven, we&#39;re Europe&#39;s largest pureplay consultancy in data and AI, and we&#39;re not slowing down.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t just offer strategies. We frame problems, design solutions, build the technology, and operate what we deliver, the distinction between those who propose and those who implement is central to how we work. We&#39;re technology-agnostic but technology-deep, with premium partnerships across Google, Anthropic, OpenAI, Databricks, and AWS, giving our consultants direct access to the newest capabilities before they reach the mainstream.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Progression here is earned, not timed. We don&#39;t run on tenure. We run on impact, and strong performers move fast. If you want to build things that matter, at a pace that matches your ambition, this is where you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK office is at an inflection point. We&#39;ve built the foundations of a category-defining consultancy, and now we&#39;re scaling, fast. Join now, and you&#39;re building the office before Artefact becomes a name every top consultant already knows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work across Retail Banking, Insurance, Private Equity, Energy &amp;amp; Utilities, Retail &amp;amp; E-commerce, CPG &amp;amp; FMCG, and Automotive, giving consultants the space to build real depth in one or two areas while staying genuinely exposed to others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our engagements run end to end, from strategy and governance through to delivery of high value data &amp;amp; AI solutions, on problems organisations are genuinely wrestling with right now: Data Platform Strategy and Build, Generative AI Strategy, Agentic AI Strategy &amp;amp; Deployment, AI Governance and Assurance, Digital Transformation, and AI Adoption and Change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that&#39;s the kind of work you want to be doing, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Consulting Manager at Artefact UK, you will take ownership of client engagements end-to-end, leading project teams and acting as the principal point of accountability for delivery quality, client relationships, and team performance. This is the level at which individual contribution gives way to team performance: your job is to create the conditions in which the people around you do their best work, while maintaining the strategic and commercial thread that connects daily delivery to long-term client value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Project ownership and delivery governance:&amp;nbsp;You will lead the full project lifecycle across one or more concurrent engagements (scoping, planning, executing, and closing) while managing timelines, budgets, and quality to a high standard. You will set projects up for success from the outset, identify risks before they become problems, and be the person your team and your clients turn to when things need resolving. Project governance is yours to run, not delegate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client relationship management:&lt;/strong&gt; You will own relationships with senior client stakeholders at Director level or above, acting as a trusted adviser across the arc of an engagement rather than just within individual workstreams. This means running steering committees and executive workshops, translating complex technical progress into clear business terms, and helping clients make better decisions with data, even when that means telling them something they don&#39;t want to hear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership and people development:&lt;/strong&gt; You will manage a team consisting of Consultants &amp;amp; Technical Profiles (e.g. Data Engineers, Data Scientists), taking genuine responsibility for their development, not just their output. That means structuring work so people are stretched without being overwhelmed, giving feedback that is specific and timely, and spotting when someone is struggling before they have to say so. You will contribute actively to performance reviews and work with the practice to support career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial contribution and account growth:&lt;/strong&gt; You will maintain a sharp commercial awareness across your accounts, identifying opportunities to deepen or extend engagements and building the relationships that enable future work. You will contribute to proposals, pitch materials, and RFP responses, and play an active role in scoping new opportunities within existing accounts. While full commercial targets sit at higher levels, the commercial role is built here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality, knowledge, and practice contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; You will hold a high bar for everything that leaves your project team: reviewing deliverables, challenging assumptions, and ensuring that what reaches a client is genuinely strong. Beyond client work, you will contribute to internal knowledge-sharing, bring back what you learn on engagements, and help shape the methodologies and tools that make Artefact better at what it does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The kind of person this works for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Consulting Manager role sits at a genuine inflection point: from doing excellent work yourself to being accountable for the work of a team. The transition is rewarding, but it asks something different of you. What we’re looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Around 4-6 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in consulting, analytics, or a client-facing data role, including at least 1-2 years where you have led teams or managed client relationships with real accountability, not just contributed to them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum academic requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of project delivery &lt;/strong&gt;you can speak to with specificity. Engagements where you owned the outcome, not just a workstream within it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable managing up and across; &lt;/strong&gt;you know how to hold a relationship with a Director-level client, give a clear steer to a junior consultant, and navigate the organisational dynamics that determine whether transformation actually happens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially curious:&lt;/strong&gt; you pay attention to how your work connects to the business you are helping, you contribute ideas in account planning conversations, and you are building the instincts that will eventually translate into commercial ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drawn to delivery, not just strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; you are energised by seeing something get built and work, not just by writing the recommendation. You hold yourself and your team to a high standard of output without being rigid about how to get there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-aware about what you don&#39;t know:&lt;/strong&gt; you ask for input when you need it, escalate problems early rather than late, and treat client feedback as useful data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We do not require a specific academic background, big-four pedigree, or a particular set of certifications.&lt;/em&gt; We hire for judgement, curiosity, and evidence that you have made things better for the clients or teams you have worked with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join Artefact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuinely diverse work and people:&lt;/strong&gt; On any given week you might work alongside a data scientist, a C-level executive, directors and more, across sectors you wouldn&#39;t encounter anywhere else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership, early:&lt;/strong&gt; You lead client relationships from your first engagement. No years of shadowing before you get a seat at the table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A genuine culture of learning:&lt;/strong&gt; From tool-specific training to testing the latest AI models to running client workshops on what you&#39;ve found, you have the liberty to pursue what interests you and share it with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent progression:&lt;/strong&gt; A clear skill framework from Junior Consultant to Director, with half-year reviews, honest feedback, and active coaching.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture that makes the day-to-day good:&lt;/strong&gt; Socials, coffee groups, sweepstakes, after-work drinks, an environment where people genuinely get along, and it shows in the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global without the travel grind:&lt;/strong&gt; Multi-market projects and a 2,500-person global network, London-based, &amp;amp; hybrid working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangement: two-three days per week working from the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will act as a trusted sparring partner to executives, steer complex transformation programs across functions, and drive organizational change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead AI Transformation Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer end-to-end execution of enterprise-level AI transformations. Identify internal champions, navigate corporate politics, manage structural blockers, and drive measurable user adoption and organizational change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; AI Use Case Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders to answer high-stakes questions: How can AI reshape their business models? How should they govern data? You don&#39;t just advise; you help evaluate model choices, discuss data privacy trade-offs, and conceptualize technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively drive the growth of our German practice. Take ownership in lead generation and pipeline conversion by engaging prospective clients, shaping proposals, and leading pre-sales and key-account expansion initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Artefact&#39;s AI Transformation perspective externally. Advance our voice in enterprise AI through expert discussions, content creation (e.g. LinkedIn, whitepapers), and opinionated, hands-on perspectives on applied AI trends and real-world adoption pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance the Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our methodologies, tools, and frameworks to keep our offering state-of-the-art. Develop reusable transformation playbooks and bring your strategic consulting or technology expertise into the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a senior advisor and role model - leading, coaching, and mentoring agile, hybrid project teams (consultants, data scientists, and engineers), fostering a fast-paced, “can-do” culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt; You are a true team player, eager to support others while scaling both the company and your own career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have approximately 5-8 years of full-time working experience in top-tier management consulting, technology consulting, or strategic corporate in-house roles. A proven track record of successfully leading and delivering data, analytics, or AI-driven transformation projects is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Change Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading complex, cross-functional transformation programs, with the ability to manage executive stakeholders, navigate corporate politics, and embed AI capabilities within client organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency &amp;amp; &quot;Builder Mindset&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong fluency in modern and applied AI (e.g., GenAI, LLMs, agentic systems, automated workflows). While you don&#39;t need to be a full-time programmer, you have a hands-on understanding and can credibly demo working AI concepts and discuss data privacy and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge about common machine learning techniques, cloud architectures, and data management principles. Excellent quantitative skills to draw strategic insights from complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding communication, presentation, and moderation skills. You have a strong presence and can translate complex technical topics into compelling arguments for non-technical senior executives, as well as bridge the gap to technical execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent academic track record with a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluency in both German and English (written and spoken) is mandatory to successfully advise our German clients and lead workshops. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact sits uniquely at the crossroads of top-tier business strategy and deep tech. You will build boardroom-level strategy expertise while staying at the absolute forefront of AI, data management, and digital value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial Freedom:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a fast-growing team in Germany, you will have high visibility from day one. You will directly help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region, bringing in your own ideas and driving business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Constant exposure to new AI solutions at the intersection of technology and business. Access to regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and the latest AI/data capabilities through our global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; We combine a high degree of self-assurance with a supportive, collaborative environment. We are entrepreneurial, fast-moving, and committed to delivering real impact - while strongly supporting each other&#39;s personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; &lt;em&gt;We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;bewerbungen-de@artefact.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über uns: Wer ist Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact ist eine weltweit führende Beratung für Daten- und KI-Dienstleistungen mit Hauptsitz in Paris. Wir verbinden die Stringenz und die strukturierte Problemlösungskompetenz einer erstklassigen Strategieberatung mit tiefgehendem Fachwissen in den Bereichen Daten, KI und Analytics, um unseren Kunden messbare geschäftliche Erfolge zu ermöglichen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mit mehr als 2.000 Consultants, Data Scientists und Engineers in 26 Ländern arbeiten wir mit den globalen Marktführern zusammen. Unser deutsches Büro befindet sich auf einem starken Wachstumskurs und berät Kunden branchenübergreifend bei ihren drängendsten strategischen Herausforderungen. Wir liefern nicht nur Präsentationen - wir schlagen die Brücke zwischen technologischen Möglichkeiten und geschäftlichen Anforderungen. Dabei begleiten wir unsere Kunden vom ersten Leuchtturm-Use-Case bis hin zur unternehmensweiten KI-Reife.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; agierst du als vertrauenswürdiger Sparringspartner für Führungskräfte, steuerst komplexe, funktionsübergreifende Transformationsprogramme und treibst den organisatorischen Wandel in großem Stil voran.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Hauptaufgaben:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KI-Transformationsprogramme leiten:&lt;/strong&gt; Du steuerst die End-to-End-Umsetzung - von fokussierten kurzen Projekten im gehobenen Mittelstand bis hin zu mehrphasigen Transformationen in Großkonzernen. Du identifizierst interne Promotoren und nimmst die Stakeholder mit, überwindest Hürden und sorgst für eine messbare Akzeptanz sowie den organisatorischen Wandel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategie &amp;amp; KI-Use-Case-Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Du arbeitest eng mit Stakeholdern auf C-Level zusammen, um geschäftskritische Fragen zu beantworten: Wie verändert KI das Geschäftsmodell? Wie sieht die passende Data Governance aus? Du berätst strategisch, hilfst aber auch konkret bei der Modellauswahl und bewertest die technische Machbarkeit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Growth vorantreiben:&lt;/strong&gt; Du treibst das Wachstum unserer deutschen Praxisgruppe aktiv voran. Mit unternehmerischer Energie übernimmst du Verantwortung bei der Lead-Generierung und Pipeline-Konvertierung, indem du potenzielle Kunden ansprichst, maßgeschneiderte Angebote konzipierst und unsere Key Accounts strategisch weiterentwickelst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Marktpräsenz: &lt;/strong&gt;Du positionierst Artefact als Go-to-Partner für Enterprise AI. Ob durch Expertendiskussionen, Content auf LinkedIn oder Whitepaper - du teilst pragmatische Einblicke zu aktuellen KI-Trends (z. B. Agentic AI) und realen Einführungswegen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklung der Praxisgruppe:&lt;/strong&gt; Du entwickelst unsere Methoden, Tools und Frameworks weiter, damit unser Angebot stets auf dem neuesten Stand bleibt. Du konzipierst wiederverwendbare Transformation-Playbooks und bringst dein strategisches Know-how oder Branchenwissen dabei direkt ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamführung &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist Mentor:in und Vorbild: Du leitest und coachst agile, hybride Projektteams (Consultants, Data Scientists und Engineers) und förderst eine dynamische „Can-Do“-Kultur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst du mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir definieren uns über eine Kultur aus Eigenverantwortung, intellektueller Neugier und starkem Teamgeist. Wir suchen motivierte und fähige Talente, die Lust auf Gestaltungsspielraum haben und die Chance nutzen wollen, gemeinsam mit uns zu wachsen und zu wachsen. Du solltest ein echter Teamplayer sein, der andere unterstützt und gleichzeitig das Unternehmen sowie die eigene Karriere vorantreiben möchte.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ca. 5-8 Jahre relevante Erfahrung in einer Managementberatung, der Tech-Branche oder einem dynamischen Umfeld (z. B. führende Start-ups oder Boutique-Beratungen). Ein Track Record in der Umsetzung von Daten-, Analytics- oder KI-Projekten ist ein Muss.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Change Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Fundierte Erfahrung in der Leitung komplexer, crossfunktionaler Transformationsprogramme sowie die Fähigkeit, dich sicher im Konzernumfeld und auf Führungsebene zu bewegen und KI-Kompetenzen nachhaltig in Kundenorganisationen zu verankern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KI-Verständnis &amp;amp; &quot;Builder-Mindset&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Du musst kein:e Full-Time-Developer:in sein, bringst aber ein tiefes, praktisches Verständnis für moderne KI-Architekturen mit (z. B. LLM-gestützte Workflows, Agentic AI, Generative AI) sowie Best Practices zur KI-Evaluierung. Du kannst KI-Konzepte glaubwürdig demonstrieren und Datenschutzthemen kompetent diskutieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytischer &amp;amp; technischer Scharfsinn:&lt;/strong&gt; Fundiertes Wissen über gängige Machine-Learning-Methoden, Cloud-Architekturen und Prinzipien des Datenmanagements. Exzellente quantitative Fähigkeiten, um aus komplexen Datensätzen strategische Erkenntnisse abzuleiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikation &amp;amp; Präsenz:&lt;/strong&gt; Herausragende Kommunikations-, Präsentations- und Moderationsfähigkeiten. Du besitzt ein starkes Auftreten und kannst komplexe technische Themen in überzeugende Argumente für das nicht-technische Senior-Management übersetzen sowie die Brücke zu den technischen Umsetzungsteams schlagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ausbildung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein exzellenter akademischer Werdegang (Bachelor/Master) in BWL, VWL, (Wirtschafts-)Informatik, Physik, Mathematik oder einem vergleichbaren quantitativen Bereich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse (in Wort und Schrift) sind zwingend erforderlich, um unsere Kunden erfolgreich zu beraten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formalia:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine gültige Arbeitserlaubnis für Deutschland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategie trifft Deep Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact bewegt sich an der einzigartigen Schnittstelle von erstklassiger Business-Strategie und Deep Tech. Du berätst bis hin zur C-Level Ebene und bleibst gleichzeitig technologisch immer an der absoluten Speerspitze der KI-Revolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Entrepreneurship:&lt;/strong&gt; Als Teil eines schnell wachsenden Teams in Deutschland genießt du von Tag eins an hohe Sichtbarkeit. Du gestaltest den Fußabdruck von Artefact in der Region direkt mit, bringst deine eigenen Ideen ein und treibst das Geschäftswachstum voran.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist am Puls der Zeit und erlebst neue KI-Lösungen an der Schnittstelle von Technologie und Business hautnah. Durch unser globales Netzwerk hast du Zugriff auf kontinuierliche Trainings - sowohl zu High-Level-Consulting-Methoden als auch zu den neuesten Data- &amp;amp; AI-Kompetenzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Macher-Kultur:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir kombinieren Ambition mit einem kollegialen, unterstützenden Umfeld. Wir bewegen uns schnell, denken unternehmerisch und feiern Erfolge gemeinsam - während wir uns gegenseitig bei der persönlichen Weiterentwicklung unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diese Position ist für die Standorte Berlin oder München ausgeschrieben.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keine Sorge, wenn du nicht alle Kriterien erfüllst! Bei Artefact schätzen wir Motivation, pragmatische Problemlösungskompetenz und Potenzial über alles. Wenn du Lust auf neue Herausforderungen hast und die KI-Revolution leidenschaftlich mitgestalten willst, freuen wir uns von dir zu hören.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vielfalt &amp;amp; Inklusion bei Artefact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Wir sind überzeugt, dass einzigartige Perspektiven Innovationen vorantreiben. Bei Artefact setzen wir uns für ein inklusives Umfeld ein, in dem jeder sich entfalten kann. Wir begrüßen und berücksichtigen alle Bewerbungen rein auf Basis von Leistung, Fähigkeiten und Potenzial - unabhängig von geschlechtlicher Identität, sexueller Orientierung, Herkunft, Ethnizität, Religion, Alter, Hintergrund oder Behinderung. Komm so, wie du bist!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bereit für den nächsten Schritt? Bitte sende uns deinen Lebenslauf, der deine Erfahrung und deine Leidenschaft für die Rolle als &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; zeigt. Wir freuen uns auf deine Bewerbung!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bei Fragen kannst du uns gerne eine Nachricht an &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;bewerbungen-de@artefact.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; senden.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&quot;fusion-responsive-typography-calculated&quot; data-fontsize=&quot;20&quot; data-lineheight=&quot;24px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est une société internationale de conseil en services data et IA, dont le siège est à Paris, qui depuis 10 ans est spécialisée dans la conception et le déploiement de technologies d’intelligence artificielle et de solutions data-driven, dont la mission est d’accélérer l&#39;adoption de l&#39;IA pour un impact positif sur les individus et les organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pionnière dans son domaine, à partir des données et de technologies avancées d’intelligence artificielle, les équipes de consultants métiers et d’ingénieurs travaillent ensemble pour développer des solutions qui créent de l’impact business et améliorent la productivité sur l’ensemble de la chaîne de valeur des entreprises, et ce dans le respect d’un usage éthique et responsable de la data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alliant le meilleur de l’expertise technologique et de l’excellence opérationnelle, Artefact accompagne plus de 1000 sociétés dans le monde pour accélérer leur transformation business, dont plus de 300 entreprises internationales telles qu’Orange, Samsung, L’Oréal ou encore Sanofi. Ses 1700 experts répartis dans 27 bureaux à travers le monde, interviennent dans tous les secteurs clés de l’économie : industrie, retail, luxe, grande consommation, santé, finance, etc…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Stagiaire Data Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, tu seras pleinement intégré(e) à une équipe de consultants. Ton rôle sera d&#39;assister nos clients dans l&#39;élaboration et la mise en œuvre de leur stratégie data, de la phase d&#39;idéation jusqu&#39;à l&#39;implémentation. Tes missions pourront inclure :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadrage / gestion des projets :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;interview clients et partenaires, mise en place de workshops, préparation des uses cases…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction de roadmaps, d’analyses data-driven avec l’équipe projet&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;et conception d&#39;infrastructures en collaboration avec nos experts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestration du bon déroulement du projet, en appliquant le cas échéant les méthodes agiles (sprints planning et reviews, backlog refinement, démos…)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille technologique et sectorielle :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;rester à l&#39;affût des dernières tendances en matière de data et d&#39;intelligence artificielle pour proposer des solutions innovantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Préparer des présentations et des supports de communication pour les comités de direction et les équipes clientes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étape 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;: Un entretien de fit avec un senior Data Consultant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étape 2&lt;/strong&gt; : Un entretien de type business case avec un premier tour avec un senior ou un manager Data Consultant. Le but de cet entretien est de tester vos méthodes et capacités déductives, votre capacité à résoudre un problème et de confirmer votre intérêt pour Artefact (1 heure)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;fusion-responsive-typography-calculated&quot; data-fontsize=&quot;20&quot; data-lineheight=&quot;24px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;tu es étudiant(e) en dernière année de cycle ingénieur ou au sein d&#39;une grand école de commerce avec une spécialisation en Data, Conseil, ou Management de l&#39;Innovation et tu recherches ton stage de fin d&#39;études&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;à partir de Janvier 2026&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fort intérêt pour la Data Science&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;et les technologies de la donnée. Tu n&#39;es pas nécessairement un(e) expert(e) technique, mais tu comprends les concepts clés du machine learning, de la Business Intelligence, et du Big Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellentes&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;compétences analytiques&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;et de synthèse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise avancée de la suite Microsoft Office (en particulier PowerPoint et Excel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une connaissance de SQL ou d&#39;un outil de visualisation de données (Power BI, Tableau) est un plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualités personnelles :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sens de la communication et du relationnel :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tu es capable de t&#39;exprimer clairement et de t&#39;adapter à différents interlocuteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivité et autonomie :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tu es force de proposition et prends des initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur et organisation :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tu es capable de gérer plusieurs tâches et de respecter les délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Français courant pour travailler en équipe et anglais professionnel obligatoire pour nos clients internationaux&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;fusion-responsive-typography-calculated&quot; data-fontsize=&quot;20&quot; data-lineheight=&quot;24px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un stage de&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;6 mois&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;basé à&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Casablanca&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant au sein d&#39;une équipe dynamique et experte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;opportunité de travailler sur des projets concrets avec des entreprises de premier plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La possibilité d&#39;être embauché(e) en CDI à la fin du stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu es passionné(e) par la data et que tu souhaites développer une double compétence en conseil et en technologie, envoie-nous ta candidature !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a global data and AI consulting firm. We help organisations turn data and AI into measurable business impact across the value chain, from strategy and operating model to data platforms, AI products and marketing. More than 2,500 consultants, data scientists and engineers work for over 1,000 clients worldwide, including Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Switzerland, our team of around 50 people works from Zurich and Lausanne with Swiss and international companies. Our work covers AI strategy and governance, data transformation and AI use cases that run in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing: Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Partner to scale Artefact’s Pharma &amp;amp; Life Sciences practice in Switzerland. Many global pharma, biotech and medtech companies run their headquarters, R&amp;amp;D, manufacturing or commercial functions from Switzerland. We already work with life sciences clients here and now want to make this practice one of the pillars of our Swiss business. This is an origination role: most of your time goes into winning new clients and expanding existing relationships. You will be based in Zurich and work with clients across Basel, Zurich and Romandie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will encompass:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling the Swiss Life Sciences practice: its offer, its client base and its team, in coordination with Artefact’s global healthcare and life sciences teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing existing client relationships and winning new clients, so that the practice moves from first references to a broad portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading senior client stakeholders (CDO/CDAO, CIO, heads of Commercial Excellence, Medical Affairs, R&amp;amp;D Operations, Manufacturing &amp;amp; Quality) through data and AI transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing project delivery and quality assurance on our life sciences engagements, and giving strategic support to ongoing client programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sparring with the Swiss Managing Partner on practice strategy and investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Among your responsibilities as Partner, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the practice and its offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on our existing life sciences work to define where data and AI create value along the pharma value chain: R&amp;amp;D and clinical development, regulatory and medical affairs, manufacturing and quality, supply chain, and commercial engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate this into a few Swiss offers with clear entry points, scope and pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the client portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a go-to-market plan for Swiss life sciences, own the pipeline and write proposals that address the client’s actual problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate pharma procurement: vendor qualification, framework agreements and preferred-supplier panels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver to the highest standard&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sponsor and oversee engagements run day to day by Engagement Managers, with multidisciplinary teams of consultants, data scientists and data/AI engineers, and ensure the quality of what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure delivery meets regulatory requirements: GxP, validation of AI systems, Swiss FADP/GDPR and the EU AI Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for client satisfaction, project margin and team experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop our knowledge base&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak and publish on AI in life sciences, for example GenAI in medical and regulatory writing, AI in clinical operations, HCP engagement, and AI governance under GxP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn our Swiss life sciences work into references and case studies, and bring them into Artefact’s global practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and develop consultants with life sciences experience, train the wider Swiss team on the domain, and own staffing on your engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–15 years of experience, including 8+ years serving pharma, biotech or medtech clients at a life sciences–focused consultancy or the life sciences practice of a strategy or technology firm. A later move in-house is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently Director, Principal or Associate Partner with a personal sales target, ready for the step to Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of origination with life sciences clients: you can name clients you opened yourself and the revenue you sold, beyond extending existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A network among decision-makers in the Swiss life sciences industry, especially in Basel and Zurich, that you are actively growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of GxP and computer system validation, and how they apply to data and AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency in data and AI: you can discuss what an AI use case needs from data, what it costs and when it pays back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English. German is a strong advantage, French a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in or willing to relocate to the Zurich area, with regular travel to Basel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape what comes next: the Swiss practice has proven itself and is growing fast. It is still small enough that you shape its clients, its offers and its team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell with a global platform: you bring the credentials, delivery capacity and AI assets of a 2,500-person firm into every proposal, and you work with industry leads across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy to production under one roof: our consultants and engineers work in the same teams, so your clients get from recommendation to working solution without changing firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture: innovation, collaboration and action shape how we work. Artefact Switzerland is Great Place to Work certified (2026).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurship: you are measured on the clients, revenue and team you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a global data and AI consulting firm. We help organisations turn data and AI into measurable business impact across the value chain, from strategy and operating model to data platforms, AI products and marketing. More than 2,500 consultants, data scientists and engineers work for over 1,000 clients worldwide, including Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Switzerland, our team of around 50 people works from Zurich and Lausanne with Swiss and international companies. Our work covers AI strategy and governance, data transformation and AI use cases that run in production.&lt;/p&gt;
