&lt;div class=&quot;e0&quot;&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;e3&quot;&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;e3&quot;&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_16d8730bebd2f083&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;Senior AI Engineer / Technical Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to bridge the gap between high-level strategy and technical execution. You will act as a &quot;builder first, consultant second,&quot; designing and deploying AI/ML solutions that solve complex business problems for global clients. This role involves end-to-end technical leadership, from initial rapid prototyping (PoCs) to scaling production-ready systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Solution Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and deploy pragmatic AI solutions (ML, LLMs, Generative AI) tailored to specific client business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical advisor to client stakeholders, translating business requirements into scalable technical architectures and guiding them on AI best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Prototyping &amp;amp; Production:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and test Proof of Concepts (PoCs) and transition them into production-ready environments, ensuring security, performance, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Design robust AI infrastructure using cloud-native services (AWS, Azure, or GCP) and modern data pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work within cross-functional teams (Data Scientists, Project Managers, and Strategy Consultants) to ensure the technical feasibility of AI initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead project workstreams and mentor junior engineers on technical best practices, MLOps, and coding standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
