&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;40&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;; familiarity with other languages (Java, C++, or Node.js) is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI/ML Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;39&quot;&gt;TensorFlow, PyTorch,&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;63&quot;&gt;HuggingFace&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Generative AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;40&quot;&gt;LLMs&lt;/strong&gt;, prompt engineering, fine-tuning, and vector embeddings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cloud Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience deploying AI solutions on &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;61&quot;&gt;AWS, GCP,&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;74&quot;&gt;Azure&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tools &amp;amp; DevOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;Git, Docker, Kubernetes,&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;62&quot;&gt;MLOps&lt;/strong&gt; principles (CI/CD for machine learning).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to build and manage ETL/ELT pipelines and work with various database schemas (SQL, NoSQL, Graph).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Engineering, or a related STEM field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and the local regional language (&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;67&quot;&gt;German or French&lt;/strong&gt;). Ability to explain complex technical concepts to non-technical business leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;builder’s mindset&quot; with the agility to work in a fast-paced, client-facing consulting environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consulting Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience in a professional services or consulting firm is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What to Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;Impactful work on global accounts (e.g., Warner Bros, Orange, L&#39;Oréal).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;A collaborative &quot;scale-up&quot; environment with a heavy focus on continuous learning and a dedicated training budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
