&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will sit at the center of this mission. You won&#39;t just deliver static slides; you will bridge the gap between technical possibilities and business imperatives, guiding clients from a focused short-term engagement with &lt;em&gt;Mittelstand&lt;/em&gt; manufacturers to multi-phase AI transformations with enterprises. In this role, you will take ownership of cross-functional workstreams, drive data-driven decision-making, and actively shape the digital future of our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with (international) clients to understand their business needs and translate them into data-driven recommendations that support strategic decision-making and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect, synthesise and iterate data to create actionable insights. You work with a modern, AI-native toolstack - from LLM-powered environments (e.g. Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT) and agentic workflow tools (e.g. n8n, Lovable) to coding assistants and automation platforms - and communicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. Familiarity with SQL or Python remains a plus, but the ability to leverage AI tools to accelerate analysis and delivery is what we value most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of project workstreams and ensure high-quality, timely delivery in alignment with overall project goals. Work collaboratively within interdisciplinary teams across consulting, data, and tech functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of data strategies, AI use cases, and business intelligence solutions, contributing to governance frameworks and implementation roadmaps where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge sharing &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to a strong team culture by sharing knowledge, staying up to date with digital and AI trends, and supporting continuous team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business development &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively contribute to Artefact’s growth in Germany - supporting client proposals, shaping new service offerings, and creating intellectual capital such as frameworks, point-of-views, and benchmarks that strengthen our market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have at least 2–3 years of experience in management consulting, technology consulting, or in-house corporate strategy roles, with a proven track record of participating in data/AI strategy, cloud transformation, or applied AI/Machine Learning projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A completed university degree (Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s) in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a strong affinity for data management and modern AI technologies. You are familiar with concepts like Generative AI, LLMs, or predictive analytics and are eager to bridge the gap between business needs and AI deployment. Ideally, you have hands-on experience in AI use case conceptualization or data platform tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You combine strong analytical skills with a business-oriented perspective. You enjoy identifying business problems and translating them into practical AI and data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident working with PowerPoint and Google Slides to produce polished client-ready output. More importantly, you know how to leverage AI tools - from LLM environments to agentic workflows - to run analysis, generate insights, and accelerate delivery. Experience with SQL, BI tools, or programming languages is not a requirement, but comfort with structured data and a hands-on attitude toward new tools is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate complex technical topics clearly in both German and English. You enjoy working in interdisciplinary teams and collaborating across different levels and functions (e.g., translating requirements between business stakeholders and data scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal attributes:&lt;/strong&gt; You are proactive, structured, and solution-oriented, with a strong client focus and stakeholder understanding. You thrive in dynamic environments and enjoy solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluent German and English are required - you will participate in client workshops, present to senior stakeholders, and write deliverables in both languages. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful client work:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on challenging projects with leading national and international clients across data, digitalisation, and advanced data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career growth opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in performance over tenure. Your growth is driven by your impact, not your length of service, with clear opportunities to progress and diverse career prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong compensation package including a performance-based bonus, which is paid out half-yearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team of passionate Data Consultants who actively support each other. You&#39;ll learn through diverse projects, collaboration, and exposure to leading experts in the field - including international work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; time off: &lt;/strong&gt;Hybrid working model, 28 days of annual leave, plus your birthday as well as Christmas &amp;amp; New Year&#39;s Eve&amp;nbsp;off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-preview__description &quot; data-test-description=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at bewerbungen-de@artefact.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über uns: Wer/Was ist Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact ist eine weltweit führende Beratung für Daten- und KI-Dienstleistungen mit Hauptsitz in Paris. Mit mehr als 2.000 Consultants, Data Scientists und Engineers in 26 Ländern arbeiten wir mit den globalen Marktführern zusammen. An unseren deutschen Standorten befinden wir uns auf einem rasanten Wachstumskurs. Wir beraten führende nationale und internationale Kunden branchenübergreifend dabei, das volle Potenzial ihrer Daten auszuschöpfen, skalierbare Datenarchitekturen aufzubauen und innovative KI-Lösungen zu implementieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Senior Consultant (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; stehst du im Mittelpunkt dieser Mission. Du lieferst nicht nur statische Präsentationen, sondern schlägst die Brücke zwischen technologischen Möglichkeiten und geschäftlichen Anforderungen. Dabei begleitest du unsere Kunden von fokussierten Kurzzeit-Projekten im gehobenen Mittelstand bis hin zu mehrphasigen KI-Transformationen in Großkonzernen. In dieser Rolle übernimmst du die Verantwortung für crossfunktionale Workstreams, treibst datenbasierte Entscheidungen voran und gestaltest die digitale Zukunft unserer Kunden aktiv mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das erwartet dich bei uns:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kundenberatung &amp;amp; Strategie:&lt;/strong&gt; Du arbeitest eng mit (internationalen) Kunden zusammen, verstehst deren geschäftliche Anforderungen und übersetzt diese in datengestützte Empfehlungen, die strategische Entscheidungen und die Business Transformation unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten &amp;amp; Analyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Du sammelst, strukturierst und bereitest Daten für Analysen auf. Mit Tools wie Excel, SQL und Python identifizierst du Trends, Muster und konkrete Handlungsempfehlungen und kommunizierst diese klar an technische sowie nicht-technische Stakeholder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projektumsetzung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du übernimmst die Verantwortung für Projekt-Workstreams und stellst eine qualitativ hochwertige, termingerechte Lieferung im Einklang mit den übergeordneten Projektzielen sicher. Dabei arbeitest du kollaborativ in interdisziplinären Teams aus den Bereichen Consulting, Data und Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Lösungen:&lt;/strong&gt; Du unterstützt die Entwicklung von Datenstrategien, KI-Use-Cases sowie Business-Intelligence-Lösungen und wirkst bei Governance-Frameworks und Implementierungs-Roadmaps mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wissenstransfer &amp;amp; Kollaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Du trägst zu einer starken Teamkultur bei, indem du dein Wissen teilst, dich über digitale Trends und KI-Entwicklungen auf dem Laufenden hältst und die kontinuierliche Weiterentwicklung des Teams unterstützt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst du mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Im Kern definieren wir uns über eine Kultur der Eigenverantwortung, der intellektuellen Neugier und der Zusammenarbeit. Wir suchen motivierte, fähige und umsichtige Talente, die hungrig auf neue Herausforderungen sind und die Chance nutzen wollen, zu lernen und zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verfügst über mindestens 2-3 Jahre Erfahrung in der Management-/Datenberatung oder in einer entsprechenden Inhouse-Funktion. Zudem bringst du nachweisbare Erfolge in den Bereichen Daten-/KI-Strategie, Cloud-Transformation oder angewandte KI-/Machine-Learning-Projekte mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Verständnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Du besitzt eine hohe Affinität für Datenmanagement und moderne KI-Technologien. Konzepte wie Generative KI, LLMs oder Predictive Analytics sind dir vertraut und du brennst darauf, die Lücke zwischen Business-Anforderungen und KI-Einsatz zu schließen. Idealerweise hast du bereits Erfahrung in der Konzeption von KI-Use-Cases oder im Data-Platform-Tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-Orientierung &amp;amp; analytisches Denken:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verbindest ausgeprägte analytische Fähigkeiten mit einer geschäftsorientierten Denkweise. Es macht dir Spaß, geschäftliche Herausforderungen zu identifizieren und sie in praktische, KI- und datengestützte Lösungen zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technische Fähigkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist sicher im Umgang mit Excel und PowerPoint. Praktische Erfahrung mit Statistik-Tools, BI-Software oder Programmiersprachen wie SQL, R oder Python zur Datenexploration und -aufbereitung ist ein klares Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikation &amp;amp; Teamgeist:&lt;/strong&gt; Du kommunizierst komplexe technische Themen sowohl auf Deutsch als auch auf Englisch klar und verständlich. Du arbeitest gerne in interdisziplinären Teams und schätzt die Zusammenarbeit über verschiedene Ebenen und Funktionen hinweg (z. B. als Übersetzer der Anforderungen zwischen Business-Stakeholdern und Data Scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persönlichkeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Du agierst proaktiv, strukturiert sowie lösungsorientiert und zeichnest dich durch eine ausgeprägte Kunden- und Stakeholder-Orientierung aus. Du blühst in dynamischen Umfeldern auf und hast Freude daran, komplexe Probleme zu lösen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse sind eine Grundvoraussetzung. Du wirst an Kunden-Workshops teilnehmen, Präsentationen vor hochrangigen Entscheidungsträgern halten und Dokumente in beiden Sprachen verfassen. Weitere Sprachkenntnisse sind von Vorteil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeitserlaubnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine gültige Arbeitserlaubnis für Deutschland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einflussreiche Kundenprojekte:&lt;/strong&gt; Arbeite an anspruchsvollen Projekten mit führenden nationalen und internationalen Kunden in den Bereichen Daten, Digitalisierung und zukunftsweisende Datenstrategie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Karriere- und Entwicklungschancen:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir glauben an Leistung, nicht an Dienstalter. Dein Aufstieg wird durch deinen Impact bestimmt, nicht durch deine Betriebszugehörigkeit - mit klaren Aufstiegsmöglichkeiten und vielfältigen Karriereperspektiven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attraktive Vergütung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein starkes Vergütungspaket inklusive eines leistungsabhängigen Bonus, der halbjährlich ausgezahlt wird.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lernen &amp;amp; Weiterentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil eines Teams aus passionierten Data Consultants, die sich gegenseitig aktiv unterstützen. Du lernst durch vielfältige Projekte, enge Zusammenarbeit und den Austausch mit führenden Experten der Branche - internationale Einsätze eingeschlossen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilität &amp;amp; Freizeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Unbegrenztes Homeoffice und flexible Arbeitszeiten, 28 Tage Jahresurlaub sowie zusätzliche freie Tage über die Feiertage (Weihnachten und Silvester frei) und an deinem Geburtstag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diese Position ist für die Standorte Berlin oder München ausgeschrieben.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keine Sorge, wenn du nicht alle Kriterien erfüllst! Bei Artefact schätzen wir Motivation, pragmatische Problemlösungskompetenz und Potenzial über alles. Wenn du hungrig auf neue Herausforderungen bist und die KI-Revolution leidenschaftlich mitgestalten willst, freuen wir uns von dir zu hören.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vielfalt &amp;amp; Inklusion bei Artefact:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Wir sind überzeugt, dass einzigartige Perspektiven Innovationen vorantreiben. Bei Artefact setzen wir uns für ein inklusives Umfeld ein, in dem jeder sich entfalten kann. Wir begrüßen und berücksichtigen alle Bewerbungen rein auf Basis von Leistung, Fähigkeiten und Potenzial – unabhängig von geschlechtlicher Identität, sexueller Orientierung, Herkunft, Ethnizität, Religion, Alter, Hintergrund oder Behinderung. Komm so, wie du bist!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bereit für den nächsten Schritt? Bitte sende uns deinen Lebenslauf, der deine Erfahrung und deine Leidenschaft für die Rolle als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; zeigt. Wir freuen uns auf deine Bewerbung!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bei Fragen kannst du uns gerne eine Nachricht an &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;bewerbungen-de@artefact.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; senden.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Swiss offices are at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant in our Zurich/Lausanne office, you will work at the intersection of strategy consulting and data and AI delivery. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions. How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organise for data? Which strategic programmes deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break complex challenges down into decisions a client can act on, combining consulting rigour with a working knowledge of what current AI can and cannot actually do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn a business question into a solution shape — what data it depends on, what kind of platform or product it should sit on, and what “good” looks like once it is built. You will do this alongside our data scientists and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support engagements end to end, from hypothesis framing and market and competitor analysis through to data maturity assessments, client workshops, governance design and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders and business unit leaders. You will build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations with clarity, and keep the work aligned to what the client is actually trying to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Zurich office by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital - frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks - and taking part in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can hold a technical position and a commercial one at the same time. The strongest candidates meet most of the following.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, Business, Economics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Around three to five years in consulting, or in a technical/date-focussed role with client-facing responsibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine dual affinity for business and technology. You are comfortable with modern data and AI concepts - generative AI and LLMs, retrieval, predictive machine learning, cloud platforms - and with what they cost and where they fail, not only with what they are called.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built AI or data products, not only advised on them. You can explain why you chose which model you put on which part of the work, and what that choice did to both output quality and cost. You will not be writing production code in this role, but you should have the basic understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills, and the judgement to know which number actually decides the question. You are comfortable getting to a defensible estimate with your assumptions stated out loud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication. You enjoy working in teams and in front of clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German/French and English, written and spoken, is strongly preferred..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and the Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is neither a traditional strategy consultancy nor a pure technology player. You will move between the boardroom and the build, and be expected to be credible in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineers, not hand-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Our 2,500 people include the data scientists and engineers you will work beside on the same engagement - not a delivery organisation you hand a slide deck to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team you will have visibility and impact from the first day. You will help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both consulting method and AI and data capability, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich or Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pt-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Artefact Belgium: Help our clients in their AI transformations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an analytically minded consultant with a passion for data, AI, and business transformation? Artefact Belgium is looking for a Senior Consultant – Strategy &amp;amp; Data/AI to help our clients navigate their most complex strategic challenges at the intersection of business and technology. If you have 2-4 years of consulting or related experience, combined with a dual affinity for strategy and data, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in AI applications to help clients achieve tangible business impact. Our Belgium office advises clients on their most pressing strategic challenges : from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You break down complex business problems into clear, structured recommendations. You are comfortable operating at the C-level and translating ambiguity into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-savvy consultant:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need to be a programmer, but you are genuinely curious about data and AI technologies and eager to deepen your expertise in this space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Engagement Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a proven capacity to lead projects client side. You excel at managing expectations, defining project scope, and providing strategic guidance to technical teams to ensure delivery aligns with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client-facing communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders, present ideas with clarity, and adapt your message to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative doer:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in multidisciplinary teams, move fast, and take ownership of your work from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambitious and driven:&lt;/strong&gt; You are motivated by impact, eager to grow, and excited by the opportunity to help shape a fast-growing office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy development: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions — How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organize for data? Which strategic programs deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve complex problems:&lt;/strong&gt; Break down ambiguous challenges into clear, actionable recommendations using structured frameworks, enriched by Artefact&#39;s data and AI expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver end-to-end engagements:&lt;/strong&gt; Support projects from hypothesis framing and market/competitor analysis to client workshops, governance design, and implementation roadmaps with the technical team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage senior stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with C-level executives and business unit leaders, building trusted relationships and ensuring strategic alignment throughout engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build knowledge and offerings: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Belgium office by shaping new service offerings, creating intellectual capital (frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks), and supporting business development efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to thought leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Publish insights, participate in industry events, and help position Artefact Belgium as a leading voice on AI and data transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s and Master&#39;s degree (preferred) in Business, Engineering, Computer Science, Economics, or a related field; an excellent academic track record is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 2-4 years of experience in strategy consulting, data/digital consulting, or a related field (including internships or business analyst roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dual affinity for business and technology — you enjoy solving complex problems and can approach challenges in a structured, strategic way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data and digital technologies (e.g. analytics, AI, machine learning concepts, digital marketing, cloud platforms); you don&#39;t need to be a programmer, but you should be tech-savvy and eager to grow in the data/AI domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with experience creating impactful presentations and reports for senior audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English and French or Dutch is required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be eligible to work in Belgium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with your expertise and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A unique positioning at the crossroads of boardroom-level strategy and cutting-edge AI — not a traditional consultancy, not a pure tech player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visibility and impact from day one as part of a growing Belgian team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional growth through regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and AI/data capabilities, combined with international exposure across Artefact&#39;s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, entrepreneurial culture of doers — innovative, fast-moving, and committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value motivation and potential above all else. Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet every criterion — if you&#39;re passionate about leveraging data and AI to drive real business impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation du poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Data Analytics d&#39;Artefact, vous rejoignez un pôle clé couvrant le dashboarding, l&#39;analytics engineering, la mesure marketing et le low-code data science. Dans un environnement à forte croissance, vous intervenez auprès de grands comptes pour transformer leurs enjeux business grâce à une collecte, un traitement et une visualisation de données performants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qu’on attend de vous :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que profil Senior, vous garantissez l&#39;excellence technique et la qualité de la valeur livrée sur vos projets analytiques. Vous jouez un rôle de conseiller de confiance auprès des clients, tout en mentorant des profils plus juniors et en intégrant les derniers usages d&#39;IA Générative appliqués à l&#39;analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la livraison de projets Analytics de bout en bout : du cadrage des cas d&#39;usage avec les équipes métier jusqu&#39;au déploiement de dashboards, pipelines et produits data décisionnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et implémenter des architectures analytiques scalables en appliquant les pratiques modernes d&#39;Analytics Engineering (modélisation de données, tests, qualité de code).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploiter les développements récents en GenAI pour maximiser la valeur délivrée à nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extraire des insights stratégiques et les restituer de manière claire et actionnable pour accompagner la prise de décision des parties prenantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en expert référent auprès des clients : construire une relation de confiance et apporter des recommandations sur les meilleures pratiques d&#39;analyse de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorer les Data Analysts juniors, partager les meilleures pratiques (ateliers, documentation) et participer à la création d&#39;accélérateurs internes et à la veille technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience &amp;amp; Mindset :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 ans ou plus d&#39;expérience concrète dans un environnement data-driven, avec autonomie, rigueur et curiosité intellectuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domaines d&#39;expertise (au moins 1) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashboarding &amp;amp; Dataviz (Power BI, Looker, Tableau, Superset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics Engineering (dbt sur BigQuery, Snowflake, Databricks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Analytics &amp;amp; Mesure (CDP, MMM, attribution, Clean Rooms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-Code / No-Code Data Science (Dataiku, Copilot Studio)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Socle Technique :&lt;/strong&gt; Solide maîtrise de SQL et Python, bases en Git et principes d&#39;ingénierie logicielle (versioning, tests), ainsi qu&#39;une expérience sur les environnements Cloud (GCP, Azure, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture &amp;amp; Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Capacité avérée à faire le pont entre équipes techniques et métier, accompagnement des profils juniors et communication claire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Call :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange initial sur votre parcours, vos motivations et l&#39;adéquation culturelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Évaluation approfondie de votre socle technique (SQL, Python, Cloud) et de vos expertises Analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Mise en situation sur la résolution de cas d&#39;usage business et la restitution analytique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fit Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange final de projection opérationnelle et de fit culturel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération :&lt;/strong&gt; Package : 53 000 € à 63 000 € brut annuel (fixe) + 5 000 € de variable, selon expérience et séniorité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation entreprise&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable. A la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients. Envie d&#39;en savoir plus? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com/?utm_source=gemini&quot;&gt;https://www.artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid working pattern&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of a data service provider, specialising in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organisations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in data consulting and digital marketing are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we’ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have over 2000 employees across 36 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: State of the art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant, you are a team leader - you will receive the coaching of the most senior people at Artefact and you will be in constant contact with our clients to drive success. You will take the responsibility and ownership of the quality and timeliness of the project delivery while contributing to the vision and organising the next steps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed in this role, the Senior Consultant needs to be a true problem-solver and project manager, relying on the expertise of others (data scientists, data engineers, or their peers and clients) and getting a very detailed understanding of what great looks like for their clients. They will be able to adapt to a vast diversity of missions while acquiring a fine knowledge of the complex organisations to make data go beyond technology and drive real business impact. Leveraging the right and smart data to improve the business outcome for our clients is the DNA of a Senior Consultant at Artefact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant, your missions will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding clients needs and build your convictions to create success in your missions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulating strategies, roadmaps, action plans and communicate them efficiently in writing and orally to the clients and other team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organising the delivery of projects end-to-end, from briefing and managing your teams to driving clients in the right direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspiring and contribute to deliverables with a desire to lead by example, while your philosophy is to create legitimacy on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving the commercial roadmaps with your managers and partners and helping to build knowledge for Artefact as you build industry / topic expertise project after project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuals who align with our values; We value potential over existing knowledge. We value ideas over hierarchy. We value actual work over nice talks. We value people over experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We love individuals who are curious and problem-solving.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a strong appetite for those who want to discover new things even when it pushes them out of their comfort zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We would appreciate people who are as passionate as us in all things digital, data and tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to demonstrate autonomy, high-quality deliverables, strong attention to detail and the ability to build long-term customer relationships is a must, you will also have a strong appetite to grow in the world of Data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artefact is the place to be: &lt;/strong&gt;come and build the future of marketing,&amp;nbsp; join a community, we have a team of experts and professionals worldwide that will always be willing to help&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get immersed into the digital and data industry:&lt;/strong&gt; meet the most innovative partners, deliver cutting-edge projects, and see the industry from backstage. Sooner than you think, you’ll talk about Machine Learning, DevOps and AI like a pro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Progress:&lt;/strong&gt; Every day offers new challenges and new opportunities to learn. At Artefact, we take training very seriously, and you’ll be coached and mentored on your technical, consulting, and interpersonal skills on a regular basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; join an diverse, collaborative, and action-oriented team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurship: &lt;/strong&gt;you will be joining a team of driven entrepreneurs, come and help industry leaders transform through data, we won’t give up until we make a huge dent in this industry!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation du poste :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) Senior Data Consultant(e) pour accompagner la transformation Data &amp;amp; IA de nos clients C-Level (COMEX, marketing, digital, supply-chain, opérations, customer support, IT...). Le/la consultant(e) pilote avec une large autonomie des projets complets de bout en bout, supervisé(e) par un n+1 (manager, directeur, partner), et encadre les consultants plus juniors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter un ou plusieurs streams : garantir le delivery, identifier les points de blocage, proposer des solutions, assurer la gestion de projet (documentation, planning, comptes-rendus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encadrer et donner des feedbacks constructifs aux membres juniors de l&#39;équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire de manière autonome les livrables de mission : présentations, benchmarks, études de cas, workshop decks, sections steerco&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des storylines et concevoir des slides percutantes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Animer les interviews et workshops clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire une relation de confiance avec les clients et identifier des opportunités business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer au développement d&#39;Artefact : développement d&#39;une offre, d&#39;une industrie, d&#39;un chapter ou d&#39;un partenariat école ; participation au recrutement et à la formation des nouveaux arrivants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soutenir et développer une ou plusieurs expertises internes (stratégie, data governance, data marketing...) via la construction d&#39;offres, la formation, ou des actions marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 à 3 ans d&#39;expérience professionnelle en cabinet de conseil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Double profil &quot;business&quot; et &quot;data&quot; : curieux(se), passionné(e) par la data et les évolutions technologiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esprit analytique, goût pour la résolution de problèmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience en gestion de clients et identification d&#39;opportunités commerciales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise de la Suite Google/Pack Office et des outils de workshop ; excellente communication en français et en anglais (écrit/oral)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localisation en plein cœur de Paris (9ème arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnement pluridisciplinaire en forte croissance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formations régulières et montée en compétences sur les méthodes de travail tech (product mindset, agilité)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture entrepreneuriale fondée sur l&#39;innovation, la collaboration et l&#39;action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Interview&lt;/strong&gt; : 30/45&#39; - entretien de motivation, culture et éligibilité avec un(e) Talent Acquisition Specialist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager &lt;/strong&gt;: Business case - partie fit (motivation, soft skills, valeurs) puis use case avec synthèse de la solution (réponse, durée, équipe)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Director&lt;/strong&gt; : Business case - partie fit (motivation, soft skills, valeurs) puis use case avec synthèse de la solution (réponse, durée, équipe)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; : Business case - partie fit (motivation, soft skills, valeurs) puis use case avec synthèse de la solution (réponse, durée, équipe)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération &lt;/strong&gt;: 53 000€ à 63 000€ brut annuel (fixe) + jusqu’à 5 000€ de variable selon expérience et séniorité&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation entreprise :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable.&amp;nbsp;A la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Envie d&#39;en savoir plus? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : https://www.artefact.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion et diversité :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Do you think like a management consultant, thrive in a high-growth environment, and can&#39;t stop thinking about the intersection of data, technology, and business strategy? Are you the person clients turn to when the problem is complex, the stakes are high, and the path forward isn&#39;t obvious yet?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;With over 2,000 employees, 36 offices on five continents, and world-class clients like Samsung, L&#39;Oréal, and Mattel, Artefact is a consulting firm that transforms data into measurable value and business impact. We&#39;ve recently launched in the US with offices in NYC and Los Angeles — and we want you to join us as a cornerstone of our founding team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Founded and headquartered in Paris, Artefact is a next-generation consulting firm specializing in data, analytics, and AI consulting — dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organizations. We don&#39;t just advise; we build, implement, and deliver results our clients can measure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We have 2,000 employees across 36 offices focused on accelerating digital transformation for some of the world&#39;s most recognizable brands. Our state-of-the-art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies, and cohesive teams of elite business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts are all laser-focused on delivering real value to every client. We design data-driven solutions tailored to each client&#39;s specific needs — always conceived with a business-first mindset and delivered with tangible, measurable results. Our expertise is built on deep AI knowledge acquired through 1,000+ client engagements across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Find out more at artefact.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As a Senior Consultant, you&#39;ll be a driving force in our US practice — leading high-impact client engagements, shaping analytical strategy, and setting the standard for delivery excellence on our founding team. You won&#39;t just surface insights; you&#39;ll own the client relationship, structure the narrative, and be directly accountable for outcomes that move the needle for major global brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;This is a high-visibility role with real scope from day one. You&#39;ll partner with senior client stakeholders, bring clarity to ambiguous problems, and translate sophisticated data work into decisions that executives act on. You&#39;ll also help shape what Artefact looks like in the US — contributing to proposals, developing thought leadership, and actively building our market presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Defining client needs through in-depth discovery — conducting structured interviews with client teams and technology partners to surface the real problem beneath the stated one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Performing advanced data analysis and rigorous research to solve high-impact, strategic challenges that matter to our clients&#39; bottom lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Building, formulating, and presenting data-driven strategic recommendations that are compelling, actionable, and boardroom-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Developing new business proposals that win — translating Artefact&#39;s capabilities into clear, persuasive value propositions for prospective clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Contributing to thought leadership and content development on business-relevant topics, including Artefact-published research, articles, and business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Taking full ownership of project delivery — ensuring workstreams are aligned, on schedule, and meeting client expectations, with support from a Manager or Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Mentoring and developing junior consultants and interns, actively investing in the talent pipeline that will define our US team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for proven leaders and sharp thinkers who are ready to make their mark — people who bring a point of view, thrive in ambiguity, and hold themselves accountable to outcomes, not just outputs. As a senior member of our founding US team, you&#39;ll help define what excellence looks like at Artefact in North America. We&#39;ll give you the platform and the tools to do your best work — and you&#39;ll arrive ready with the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Undergraduate degree with strong academic performance; advanced degree (MBA or MSc in a quantitative field) is a significant asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;3–5 years of full-time experience in one or more of the following: consulting, data/analytics, marketing, advertising, finance, or tech — with a clear track record of client-facing delivery and independent problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills; you can represent Artefact with confidence and credibility at the senior client level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and collaborate across diverse, multicultural teams; strong intercultural communication skills are essential in our global environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel and PowerPoint; experience with SQL, Python, or R is a strong differentiator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Genuine passion for data, digital, and the broader tech and AI economy — you follow this space because you love it, not because you have to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A natural teaching orientation and demonstrated ability to mentor junior team members; you make the people around you better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of strategy consulting and/or digital marketing — within a consultancy, start-up, or agency — is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At this stage in your career, you have options. Here&#39;s what makes Artefact different:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership, right away.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re building our US practice from the ground up, which means your contributions don&#39;t disappear into a bureaucracy — they shape the trajectory of an entire market.&lt;/p&gt;
