&lt;p&gt;Are you a seasoned AI professional with a passion for generative AI and Large Language Models (LLMs)? Artefact Belgium is looking for a Senior Data Scientist - Gen AI to drive innovation and lead cutting-edge projects. If you have at least four years of experience in AI and consulting, combined with a talent for project and team management, we invite you to shape the future of LLM-driven solutions with us in Brussels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced professional: At least 4 years of experience in AI, with a strong background in consulting and delivering impactful projects for diverse clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leader and collaborator: Proven experience managing teams, guiding junior colleagues, and fostering collaboration in multidisciplinary environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative thinker: Able to identify emerging trends in generative AI and apply them to real-world challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented: Comfortable handling end-to-end project delivery, from ideation and development to deployment and client engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
