&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a leading Data &amp;amp; AI consulting firm at the forefront of AI innovation. With a global presence, we collaborate with top-tier clients across industries, including healthcare, manufacturing, and media, to harness the transformative power of generative AI. Our team in Belgium is specialized in LLM and GenAI projects, working on the most advanced applications of these technologies. Our inclusive and forward-thinking culture encourages creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and deliver LLM projects: Manage the design, development, and deployment of advanced LLM-powered solutions, including RAG systems, agentic AI architectures, and multi-modal applications for our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical excellence: Architect and deploy advanced AI systems leveraging cutting-edge techniques such as parameter-efficient fine-tuning (LoRA/QLoRA), prompt orchestration, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), function/tool calling, multi-agent workflows, and emerging interoperability standards like the Model Context Protocol (MCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish evaluation frameworks: Design and implement comprehensive quality metrics and benchmarks to ensure production-ready, reliable AI solutions that meet client requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and manage teams: Guide junior engineers and data scientists in implementing cutting-edge AI technologies, fostering best practices in LLM development and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and strategize: Drive experimentation with state-of-the-art LLMs to identify new use cases, optimize performance through techniques like quantization and inference optimization, and develop generative AI tools and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable infrastructure: Oversee the deployment and maintenance of AI systems, including model serving, API development, vector databases, orchestration frameworks (LangChain, LlamaIndex), and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with clients: Collaborate with client teams to translate their business needs into impactful AI solutions, providing technical leadership and strategic guidance throughout project lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape our expertise: Contribute to the company&#39;s thought leadership by publishing insights, presenting at conferences, or driving internal training on emerging LLM technologies and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in computer science, engineering, mathematics, or a related field; advanced degrees (MSc or PhD) are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4 years of professional experience in AI, with a strong focus on Data, Machine Learning, LLMs, or generative AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting experience, including managing client relationships and delivering tailored solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern LLM techniques including fine-tuning, RAG systems, agentic AI, evaluation frameworks, and production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python and extensive experience with NLP/AI frameworks (e.g., Hugging Face, OpenAI, Anthropic, LangGraph, Agno, ….).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership and project management skills, with a proven track record of managing teams and delivering complex AI projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills. Proficiency in English, Dutch, or French is required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with your expertise and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-impact opportunities to work with state-of-the-art LLM technologies and solve real-world challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership role in a dynamic, collaborative, and innovative work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional growth through dedicated resources for training, conferences, and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to shape the direction of a fast-growing AI team within a global consulting firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, inclusive workplace with access to global expertise through Artefact&#39;s network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in Brussels, with opportunities to collaborate on projects worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Artefact Belgium, we value expertise, leadership, and a drive to innovate. If you&#39;re ready to lead and make a tangible impact in the world of generative AI, we&#39;d love to hear from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
