&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;specializing in the marketing domain,&lt;/strong&gt; you will lead and conduct ambitious projects aimed at transforming clients through data. Your day-to-day responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading transformational projects:&lt;/strong&gt; spearheading ambitious projects that utilize data to transform our clients’ operations and strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing data science solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; creating innovative data science products and solutions for both clients and our internal data science team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applying data science in marketing contexts:&lt;/strong&gt; leveraging data science methodologies to enhance &lt;strong&gt;marketing analytics, customer segmentation, attribution modeling, and campaign optimization&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building client relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; collaborating closely with your Consulting counterpart to understand client needs and strengthen relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upskilling the team:&lt;/strong&gt; contributing to the development of our data science team by sharing knowledge, mentoring junior Data Scientists, and promoting our work within other data departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensuring quality deliverables:&lt;/strong&gt; caring for team morale and ensuring that all missions are delivered to a high standard, providing feedback and support to less experienced team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimising code:&lt;/strong&gt; writing highly optimized code to advance Artefact’s internal toolbox and knowledge base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will learn with us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-World impact:&lt;/strong&gt; deliver impactful projects by developing end-to-end machine learning pipelines to solve real-world problems across various industries, including marketing and customer intelligence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; work in feature teams alongside other data scientists, ML engineers, data engineers, software engineers, and product owners to build complex solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
