&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise development:&lt;/strong&gt; become an expert in one of our data science practices: Time Series Forecasting, MLOps, NLP, Computer Vision, Optimization, or Customer Intelligence, including marketing analytics, attribution modeling, and incrementality testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Algorithm discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; discover state-of-the-art algorithms and test them on real-world data during client projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking someone who has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
