&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un profil avec une double casquette : ‘&lt;strong&gt;Business&lt;/strong&gt;’ et ‘&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;’&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes curieux(se) et passionné(e) par les sujets liés à la data et à l’évolution technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un état d&#39;esprit analytique et aimez la résolution de problèmes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez de l&#39;expérience dans la gestion des clients, vous savez comment identifier les opportunités commerciales et vous aimez les interactions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous faites preuve de rigueur et proactivité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez : Suite Google/Pack Office, outils de workshop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une excellente communication (écrite / orale) en &lt;strong&gt;Français&lt;/strong&gt; et en &lt;strong&gt;Anglais&lt;/strong&gt; est obligatoire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mélange unique de talents (Data consultants, Data Analyst, Data scientist, software engineer), et une hyper croissance continue offrant de nombreuses opportunités de carrières rapides.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un endroit idéal pour apprendre : Vous maîtriserez les compétences clés du monde de l&#39;entreprise de demain : vous recevez des formations régulières sur la technologie (offre Artefact, technologies de la donnée,...), votre travail en équipes hybrides, vous apprenez les façons de travailler spécifiques à la tech (product mindset, agilité...). A la fin de votre expérience Artefact, vous êtes un leader technologique expérimenté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La culture : Innovation, Collaboration et Action sont nos valeurs, pour faire simple, nous sommes des faiseurs qui travaillent ensemble afin de créer des solutions innovantes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esprit d&#39;entreprise : vous rejoindrez une équipe d&#39;entrepreneurs motivés. Nous n&#39;abandonnerons pas tant que nous n&#39;aurons pas fait un grand pas dans ce secteur !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO Content Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who we are&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a new generation of data service provider, specialising in data consulting and data-driven digital marketing, dedicated to transforming data into business impact across the entire value chain of organisations. We are proud to say we’re enjoying skyrocketing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our broad range of data-driven solutions in digital marketing and data consulting are designed to meet our clients’ specific needs, always conceived with a business-centric approach and delivered with tangible results. Our data-driven services are built upon the deep AI expertise we’ve acquired with our 1000+ client base around the globe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have over 2000 employees across 26 offices who are focused on accelerating digital transformation. Thanks to a unique mix of company assets: state-of-the-art data technologies, lean AI agile methodologies for fast delivery, and cohesive teams of the finest business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, data engineers, and digital experts, all dedicated to bringing extra value to every client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;Head of SEO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the SEO Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20+ strong SEO team based in London and Cornwall, UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are a close-knit team who work hard but also have a lot of fun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Although we have a hierarchy, we like to operate in an open and inclusive way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No idea or question is a bad one - if you want to see change, then be the change, and if you want to make something happen, just say!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team is made up of SEO generalists, technical SEO experts, SEO content writers and Digital PR specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have great collaboration between our main London office and our satellite Cornwall office. Last year we went on a trip to Cornwall together - we surfed, walked and had fun.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;These trips aren’t mandatory, so if they’re not for you that’s ok too!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work with clients across automotive, luxury fashion, travel, charity, technology sectors and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The DEI team at Artefact is led by two members of the SEO team - DEI is very important to us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and own the department’s SEO content strategy, standards and ways of working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn client objectives and search insights into commercially focused content strategies with clear, business-aligned success measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop effective content strategies which align with the other SEO disciplines (tech and digital PR) to help our clients exceed their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define best practice methodologies, sharing with the wider team and ensuring full integration with all Organic projects, with focus on GEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge briefs and provide clear, evidence-based strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work confidently with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support existing clients, new opportunities and pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the agency’s content-planning process and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across several teams as the senior content-strategy specialist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least five years’ SEO experience, including two+ years in a management role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop commercially focused SEO content strategies and lead complex projects involving clients, internal teams and third parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of keyword research, content audits, gap analysis, briefing, production and optimisation, balancing search performance with audience, brand and conversion needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and experience using a range of SEO tools to inform decisions, measure performance and demonstrate results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent client-management and communication skills, with the ability to explain complex concepts and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing, mentoring and developing team members while building a collaborative, accountable culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up-to-date knowledge of search developments and Google best practice, with excellent attention to detail and proficiency in Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Desirable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appreciation of UX best practice principles and how these should align with SEO recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using seoClarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why You Should Join Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client business obsession: constantly listening to clients, and then continuously testing, enhancing, and keeping up with clients’ changing challenges and needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Artefact is the place to be: come and build the future of marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progress: Every day offers new challenges and new opportunities to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture: join the best team you could ever imagine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurship: You will be joining a team of driven entrepreneurs. We won’t give up until we make a huge dent in this industry!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Do you thrive on building people functions from the ground up, love partnering directly with leadership to shape culture and talent strategy, and get energized by fast-paced, scaling environments?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Join Artefact, a global data and AI consulting firm helping organizations turn data into business impact. With 2,000+ employees across 34 offices worldwide, we partner with world-class clients such as Samsung, L&#39;Oréal, and LVMH to accelerate digital transformation through data and AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Founded in Paris, Artefact has grown from a small team into a global organization — and our people strategy has had to scale right alongside it. As we enter our next phase of growth in the US and Canada, we&#39;re looking for a Sr. HRBP ready to help build the systems, culture, and talent foundation that will support that growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Find out more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com/&quot;&gt;artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As Sr. HRBP you will lead several areas central to Artefact’s continued growth: employee relations, manager advisory, talent development, onboarding, and employee experience. You will also oversee benefits administration and the execution of immigration and global mobility programs across North America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Head of People, you will have the autonomy to shape these programs and translate People strategy into practical, scalable experiences for employees and managers. You will work directly with business leaders, Chapter Leads, employees, the Resource Manager, and global People partners to strengthen how Artefact supports, develops, and retains its people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is designed for someone who enjoys building, solving complex people challenges, advising managers, and staying close to the employee experience. You will have broad visibility, meaningful access to leadership, and the opportunity to influence how Artefact’s North American People practices evolve as the business grows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Relations and Manager Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary day-to-day People advisor to employees and managers across the United States and Canada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage employee relations matters, including investigations, conflict resolution, performance concerns, accommodations, and workplace issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coach managers through feedback, difficult conversations, employee concerns, and employment decisions with empathy, consistency, and sound judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop practical guidance that helps managers navigate employee matters confidently and consistently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify recurring employee and manager concerns and recommend appropriate policy, process, training, or organizational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Head of People and employment counsel on sensitive, complex, or high-risk matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the consistent implementation and application of North American People policies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead manager coaching and enablement, including feedback, development conversations, team effectiveness, and difficult performance discussions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design and deliver manager, leadership, and professional-development initiatives aligned with organizational needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own performance-related employee relations matters, including performance concerns, documentation, performance-improvement plans, corrective action, and manager guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Resource Manager on talent reviews, individual development plans, and organization-wide capability gaps, bringing manager and employee-relations insights alongside performance, skills, staffing, and career-development data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Resource Manager and Chapter Leads to translate identified capability gaps into appropriate technical, professional, manager, and leadership-development initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Translate employee-relations, manager, and talent insights into recommendations for development, policy, and organizational improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Step in to support Talent Acquisition during high-volume hiring periods, as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding and Employee Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Set the standards and program design for the North American onboarding experience from preboarding through an employee’s first 90 days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure onboarding introduces new hires to Artefact’s business, culture, expectations, career framework, and ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee onboarding delivery and continuously improve the experience using new-hire, manager, and business feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Establish the processes and standards that recruiting or operational support resources will follow when coordinating day-to-day onboarding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead employee-listening, engagement, and employee-experience initiatives aligned with organizational priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Translate employee feedback into practical recommendations for leadership, managers, and People programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits, Immigration and Global Mobility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead day-to-day benefits administration across North America, including employee guidance, vendor coordination, issue resolution, communications, and annual enrollment support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Head of People on benefits strategy, plan design, renewals, budget, and significant employee-impact decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Execute immigration, work-authorization, and global mobility processes across the United States and Canada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Guide employees, candidates, and managers through immigration and mobility processes while coordinating with immigration counsel and external providers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate case tracking, documentation, communications, and compliance throughout the employee lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Escalate material legal, financial, workforce, or employee-experience risks to the Head of People.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Programs and Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support compensation, job architecture, pay-equity, and succession-planning initiatives led by the Head of People.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Resource Manager on the implementation of career paths and related employee-development practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Use recruiting, employee-relations, talent, benefits, and employee-experience data to identify trends and support decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Head of People and Resource Manager to strengthen core employee-lifecycle processes and maintain clear ownership across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify practical uses of AI and technology that reduce administrative work and improve the employee and manager experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to regional and global People initiatives that cut across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Eight to ten years of progressive People or HR experience, ideally in a high-growth technology, consulting, or professional-services environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong experience across talent acquisition, employee relations, manager advisory, and manager, leadership, or professional development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A track record of building or significantly improving People programs, systems, and processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting employees and leaders across the United States and Canada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong judgment and the ability to balance employee experience, business priorities, and organizational risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Confidence advising senior leaders and constructively challenging decisions when needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience developing recruiting strategies and overseeing full-cycle hiring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience coaching managers and handling complex performance and employee-relations matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing or delivering manager, leadership, or professional-development initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of compensation benchmarking, job architecture, workforce planning, benefits, immigration, and global mobility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort using People data to identify trends, measure effectiveness, and guide decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Interest in using technology and AI to improve how People teams work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong project-management skills and the ability to move several priorities forward at once.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative, solutions-oriented approach and willingness to remain close to execution while building for scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting employees in Quebec.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Greenhouse or a similar applicant-tracking system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience implementing or optimizing an HRIS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working within a global or multi-country People function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience building campus or early-career recruiting programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with consulting, utilization-based businesses, or other project-based organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;PHR, SHRM-CP, SHRM-SCP, CHRP, or an equivalent credential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;During your first year, you will have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Built trusted relationships with employees, managers, and business leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strengthened manager capability and the quality of feedback, development conversations, and employee decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Established a consistent and effective approach to employee relations and performance-related employee matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Delivered manager, leadership, and professional-development initiatives aligned with organizational needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partnered effectively with the Resource Manager on talent reviews, individual development plans, and organization-wide capability gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Used employee-relations and manager insights to inform broader development and organizational priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Improved onboarding and the early employee experience across North America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Delivered responsive benefits, immigration, and global mobility support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Introduced practical tools, programs, and insights that improve the employee and manager experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Artefact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A front-row seat to the AI and data industry at a pivotal moment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Meaningful ownership and visibility within a growing North American business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
